{"time": "20261117T172315Z", "think": "Check which marker number points at the gate.", "command": "journal", "result": "At the Kings' Gate\n- I carry all three seal-stones of the kings' gate. I'm to bring them to Never-Writes-Twice, who stands at the back of Nesh-Deeka's House in Helstrom.\n- Never-Writes-Twice made me a Ka-Deelith, a War-Teacher of the Toh-Reel-Ka, and gave me the order's pike. Her watchers have not seen the Unbound near Teku-Sul, so I am ahead of them. I'm to dive to Teku-Sul Spire, open the Kings' Gate with the three stones and use the Eye where it sits to heal the trees. Then I'm to bring the stones back to her and hunt down Cuts-the-Old-Knot.\nObjective: Dive to Teku-Sul Spire and go to the Kings' Gate.\nMarker 1: The Kings' Gate\nYou carry: Lockpick x2, Unbound-Note, Voh-Vastei-Armour, Eye-Setting, Keystone, Grave-Stake, Paralysis-Poison x3, Bronze-Disc, Parchment-Map, Rapier, Sap-Jar, Reelka-Cuirass, Reelka-Helm, Seal-Stone of the Kings, Seal-Stone of the Kings, Bronze-Key, Seal-Stone of the Kings, Ka-Deelith's Pike, Toh-Reel-Ka Gauntlets and Boots; 1650 gold.", "summary": {"stage": 20, "at": "helstrom", "items": {"item.lockpick": 2, "thing.mn.unbound-note": 1, "item.mn05.voh-vastei-armour": 1, "thing.mn.eye-setting": 1, "thing.mn.keystone": 1, "thing.mn.grave-stake": 1, "thing.mn.paralysis-poison": 3, "thing.mn.bronze-disc": 1, "thing.mn.parchment-map": 1, "thing.mn10.rapier": 1, "thing.mn12.sap-jar": 1, "thing.mn13.reelka-cuirass": 1, "thing.mn13.reelka-helm": 1, "thing.mn.seal-stone-thief": 1, "thing.mn.seal-stone-vault": 1, "thing.mn16.bronze-key": 1, "thing.mn.seal-stone-deep": 1, "thing.mn17.order-pike": 1, "thing.mn17.stormhold-rest": 1}, "gold": 1650, "flags": {"flag.mn03.truth": true, "flag.mn06.note-read": true, "flag.mn06.done": true, "flag.main.seal-question": true, "flag.main.rank-toh-wo": true, "flag.mn11.rubbing-read": true, "flag.mn11.done": true, "flag.mn12.trapdoor": true, "flag.mn12.door-tried": true, "flag.mn12.cellar-seen